_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pJu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6ae6e973-3a9e-4707-a08c-144d7b11fc48","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"ユーザーディレクトリ内のgoフォルダにキャッシュが溜まる仕組みみたいだったので。","ts":"1629129563.255200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YS/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c7abd269-9363-4e77-bc0f-1fa93883f94c","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"一つ思ったんですが、キャッシュ全削除は試されました？","ts":"1629129517.254400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4+Ot"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f24be22a-f166-4a6b-8f9c-da20423ec783","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"追っかけるのは厳しそうだ","ts":"1629129470.253800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SMm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f6d748b-1c76-4c76-8bad-f8f58e6ae70d","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"もう一度`go run`で検証してみたんですが、やっぱり落ちることはなかったです…。","ts":"1629129289.253400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B/9i"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d11894c9-55a4-4936-a8c9-95de8cf8f433","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"go1.16.7でコンパイルしたんですけど。（go runとgo buildどちらも同じく）","ts":"1629128160.252800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+xD3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f00b02a1-f928-40f6-bd51-675dac13a0fb","type":"message","user":"U022PB40WAF","text":"もしかしてコンパイラのバージョンが古いと落ちやすくなるとか？","ts":"1629128066.252100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fvidh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"055d1751-ec76-4e11-9934-6f750958f85b","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"MinGW が吐く DLL の問題","ts":"1629128008.251500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type